								<figcaption>{scene.shot.caption}</figcaption>
							</figure>
						</li>
					))}
				</ol>
				{part.id === 'after-crew' && (
					<p class="fd-gate">
						Invited teammates join as Staff today. Staff can open cost screens, and there is no custom
						role; the full Owner, Manager and Staff boundary, and what each can and cannot open, is on
